---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
	title="Terms & Conditions — Cute Timer | Cute Pomodoro Timer"
	description="The terms and conditions for using Cute Timer, the free cute pomodoro timer for studying. Simple, fair rules for a simple, free tool."
	canonical="https://cutepomodorotimer.com/terms/"
>
	<p class="eyebrow text-[var(--accent-ink)]">Fair and friendly ♡</p>
	<h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">Terms & Conditions</h1>
	<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
		Last updated: <span class="font-semibold text-ink">August 9, 2026</span>. By accessing or using
		<span class="font-semibold text-ink">cutepomodorotimer.com</span> ("Cute Timer", "the Service"), you agree to
		these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the Service.
	</p>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">1. Use of the Service</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Cute Timer is a free tool provided for your personal, non-commercial use. You may use it to run timers,
			manage a to-do list, and listen to our lo-fi tracks while you work. You agree not to misuse the Service,
			attempt to disrupt it, or use it for any unlawful purpose.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">2. No accounts, no data</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			The Service runs entirely in your browser. We don't create accounts and we don't store your to-do list or
			settings on our servers. Your data lives in your browser's local storage and you're responsible for backing
			it up (or simply letting it go) as you see fit.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">3. Intellectual property</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			The Cute Timer name, logo, mascot ("Pommy"), artwork, and all content on this site are our property or the
			property of their respective owners. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or re-sell any part of the
			Service or its design without permission.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">4. The Service is provided "as is"</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Cute Timer is provided free of charge and "as is", without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We
			don't guarantee that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or available at all times. You use the
			Service at your own risk.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			To the maximum extent permitted by law, Cute Timer and its creators won't be liable for any indirect,
			incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of — or inability to use — the Service. This
			includes missed deadlines, lost productivity, or a stray nap that lasted too long.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">6. Changes to these terms</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the Service after changes are posted means you
			accept the updated terms.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">7. Contact</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Have a question about these terms? Reach out at
			<a
				href="mailto:hello@cutepomodorotimer.com"
				class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent-ink)] underline decoration-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--accent)_50%,transparent)] underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-ink"
				>hello@cutepomodorotimer.com</a
			>.
		</p>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
